OL,3,GNEWSAProposal to turn closed nightclub 
OL,4,Ainto flats                             
OL,6,FPlans have been lodged to convert a    
OL,7,Fformer coastal clubbing hotspot into   
OL,8,Fflats, just over two months after the  
OL,9,Fnews of its closure.                   
OL,11,FProposals to convert the ex-nightclub  
OL,12,FHavana, in Whitley Bay, into six flats 
OL,13,Fhave been handed to North Tyneside     
OL,14,FCouncil.                               
OL,16,FThe application outlines a bid for     
OL,17,Fthree two-bedroom and three one-bedroom
OL,18,Fapartments at the South Parade site,   
OL,19,Fand comes after Havana - which opened  
OL,20,Fin the 2000s - closed its doors for the
OL,21,Ffinal time in September.               
